Package: spawnBayes
Title: Estimate Spawner Abundance and Run Timing from Live Count Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Patrick", "Thompson",
           email = "patrick.thompson@dfo-mpo.gc.ca",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits Bayesian models to repeated live-count surveys to estimate
    annual spawner abundance and run timing. Provides tools for model fitting,
    diagnostics, visualization, and extraction of abundance estimates.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/SiRE-P/spawnBayes
